<title>USA: TABLE - Simon DeBartolo sells notes.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Simon DeBartolo sells notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following two-tranche issue from Simon DeBartolo Group Inc priced  Thursday, according to lead manager Merrill Lynch &amp; Co.</p>
<p>Simon DeBartolo Group is a self-run REIT, develops, amages, owns malls, and shopping centers.</p>
<p>BORROWER SIMON DEBARTOLO GROUP INC</p>
<p>AMT $100 MLN	 COUPON 6.75 PCT   MATURITY 7/15/2004</p>
<p>TYPE SNR NOTES     ISS PRICE 99.575  FIRST PAY DATE 1/15/1998</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BAA1  YIELD 6.828 PCT   PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB	 SPREAD +65 BPS    CALLABLE  NO</p>
<p>AMT $150 MLN	 COUPON 7.00 PCT   MATURITY 7/15/2009</p>
<p>TYPE SNR NOTES     ISS PRICE 99.284  FIRST PAY DATE 1/15/1998</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BAA1  YIELD 7.09 PCT    PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB	 SPREAD +90 BPS    CALLABLE  NO</p>
<p>((U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1678))</p>
